{common:block}
A pad tag can have variables/options/parameters
<p><table border=0>
<tr><td>- variables are:</td><td> $name=&lt;expresion&gt;</td></tr>
<tr><td>- options are:</td><td> name=&lt;expresion&gt;</td></tr>
<tr><td>- parameters are: &nbsp; </td><td> &lt;expresion&gt;</td></tr>
</table>
<p>{app:tag 'variables'/}, {app:tag 'options'/} & {app:tag 'parameters'/} belong to the  <a href="?pages/properties">properties</a> tags
{/common:block}

{pad:page 'miscellaneous/options_variables_parameters'/}
